OL,3,AWhite House 'repeatedly violated' court
OL,4,Aorder to restore press access, say
OL,5,Amedia outlets
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree US media outlets have requested
OL,8,Fan emergency court hearing, accusing
OL,9,Fthe White House of having "repeatedly
OL,10,Fviolated" a judge's order to restore
OL,11,Ftheir access in a stand-off with
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,14,FEmployees from CNN, Politico and MS Now
OL,15,Freported being denied entry on Thursday
OL,16,Fmorning, with some having their
OL,17,Fcredentials confiscated, while others
OL,18,Fwere granted access.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
