OL,3,AWhite House 'repeatedly violated' court
OL,4,Aorder to restore press access, say
OL,5,Amedia outlets
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudge Timothy Kelly ruled in the early
OL,8,Fhours of Thursday that Trump's ban on
OL,9,Fthe outlets should be temporarily
OL,10,Flifted because it "likely violated
OL,11,Ftheir constitutional due process
OL,12,Frights".
OL,14,FTrump initially said he banned the
OL,15,Foutlets because of "fake news". The
OL,16,FWhite House later cited national
OL,17,Fsecurity.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
